{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人「妹頭」盧頌恩近日挑戰人生首套舞台劇《辦公室劇后》，前晚（23日）才順利完成首場，未料次日即遇上「死亡第二場」噩夢。</p><p>妹頭昨日（24日）拍片透露自己突然急性失聲，片中的她眼濕濕且聲線沙啞，直言極度驚慌，深怕對不起入場觀眾及影響演出。</p><p>雖然她</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:05.413700+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:46:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_hash":"002b26e5d20b3ec9d8a61880ae4fbdf48bb6b4bc5a0cf857b18d879d1c820da6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}